"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Depois de dizer adeus para Jane, nós ficamos muito tristes.","e":"After saying goodbye to Jane, we were very sad.","s":"tatoeba","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.841871,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"7397e87de3b00756e60cb027ddcda9f7","i":"d8d786cea508f62ee250abdf628cff06","r":"1499425:1003124","c":"Brunosprak","su":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1499425","ul":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1499425","b":"Tatoeba sentence #1499425 by Brunosprak; English translation #1003124 by ellasevia","o":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1499425","tu":1,"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Estamos realmente tristes porque ela estava de boa saúde, estava aliás alegre, hoje à tarde.","e":"We are really saddened because she was in good health, she was actually jolly this afternoon.","s":"tatoeba","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.913398,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"170a89fff913fdb53d2f315bfa0ad8a3","i":"699273cbf4dea25969576c71a6d97b24","r":"11034368:11034366","c":"Cangarejo","su":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/11034368","ul":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/11034368","b":"Tatoeba sentence #11034368 by Cangarejo; English translation #11034366 by Cangarejo","o":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/11034368","tu":1,"w":["leaf",0]}],[{"t":"Vamos embebedar-nos e contar um ao outro histórias tristes.","e":"Let's get trashed and tell each other our sob stories.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.770528,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"13f61006d3407c17a1ed37b4e7141161","i":"523fa07b3536d96118b60fdcc3f0aaa5","r":"4950308:6982016:487:3106908","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4950308","6982016","487"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Oh, uau. Nestas últimas semanas, as tuas piadas têm ficado muito tristes.","e":"You know, in these last few weeks, your jokes, they've gotten quite sad.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE